{"updated":"2026-09-17T17:50:41.800Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: The UK’s King Charles warns AI leaders of ‘existential dangers’. Elsewhere, wife of US scholar jailed in China asks Trump to raise arrest at Xi meeting. And UN fact-finding mission says US committed possible war crimes in Iran. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on US, at active conflict levels, though Iran, and Ukraine are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, felt the weight of it — the S&P 500 down 1.4 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial down 3.1 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite down 0.9 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 34 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 6.5 near 165 km W of Nikolski, Alaska. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.1,0.16,0.2,0.22,0.28,0.33,0.36,0.4,0.44,0.49,0.52,0.56,0.59,0.61,0.66,0.78,0.89,1.07,1.31,1.43,1.47,1.5,1.52,1.57,1.59,1.61,1.64,1.68,1.73,1.8,1.86,1.9,1.94,1.99,2.03,2.07,2.1,2.16,2.21,2.25,2.29,2.33,2.37,2.42,2.46,2.51,2.57,2.63,2.71,2.82,2.94,3.09,3.11,3.16,3.18,3.24,3.29,3.34,3.46,3.55,3.61,3.68,3.71,3.77,3.82,3.85,3.9,3.92,3.95,3.99,4.02,4.04,4.06,4.11,4.16,4.23,4.28,4.37,4.45,4.52,4.63,4.67,4.72,4.75,4.81,4.92,5.07,5.25,5.76,5.82,5.85,5.88,5.96,6.11,6.22,6.37,6.41,6.48,6.54,6.62,6.65,6.69,6.75,6.78,6.85,6.92,6.98,7.04,7.09,7.16,7.41,7.5,7.58,7.65,7.73,7.79,7.87,8.2,8.24,8.34,8.39,8.45,8.5,8.56,8.62,8.64,8.7,8.75,8.79,8.82,8.87,8.9,9.02,9.1,9.22,9.28,9.33,9.4,9.45,9.51,9.55,9.6,9.65,9.72,9.78,9.85,9.91,10,10.05,10.12,10.18,10.36,10.43,11.03,11.14,11.21,11.27,11.33,11.38,11.45,11.49,11.55,11.7,11.75,11.96,12.04,12.15,12.21,12.26,12.29,12.33,12.35,12.47,12.62,12.77,12.82,12.86,12.91,12.96,13,13.07,13.12,13.15,13.25,13.3,13.4,13.46,13.53,13.57,13.6,13.64,13.68,13.71,13.78,13.83,13.91,13.98,14.06,14.18,14.42,14.57,14.65,14.77,14.8,14.84,14.88